# Logs — anchored to backend's runtime log output dir only (a bare `logs/` here would match
# ANY directory named "logs" anywhere in the repo, which silently swallowed the new
# backend/src/modules/logs/ module — logging-instrumentation-2026-07-22 foundation fix).
backend/logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

