# ── Local development-only artifacts (2026-07-26) ───────────────────────────────────────
# Useful to keep on THIS machine while debugging; never meant for other developers or CI.

# Tester bug-report drops: log bundles a tester zips up and sends over (backend.log,
# error.log, frontend/<sessionId>.log). Can be tens of MB and contains real session data —
# keep locally while diagnosing, never commit. The folder name is literally what it says.
temp delete later/
temp-delete-later/

# Ad-hoc debugging/verification scripts. Convention: anything suffixed *_tmp or *.scratch.
# Agents and manual debugging sessions generate these (one-off import probes, row inspectors,
# API round-trip checks). If a script earns permanence, rename it into backend/scripts/.
*_tmp.mjs
*_tmp.js
*_tmp.cjs
*.scratch.mjs
*.scratch.js
scratch/

# Playwright/browser test harness run locally (the MCP server is pinned to a system-Chrome
# channel that isn't installed here, so browser testing runs from a local harness instead).
# Screenshots/traces/videos are debugging output, not deliverables.
playwright-report/
test-results/
*.har
screenshots/
*-screenshot.png
page-*.png

# Claude outputs
Claude outputs/
